    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always seen math as a tool for understanding the world, especially in physics and computer science. I enjoy solving problems and finding patterns, even if they’re complex. My background in engineering and daily use of math in coding make it practical and engaging. I don’t see it as rigid or intimidating, but as a language of logic and structure.",
